+//
+// A NON-ZERO CODE HERE IS A VERDICT, NOT A FAULT. Only `1` and `2` report that
+// this shell went wrong; `11`, `12` and `13` are it working exactly as designed
+// — the anti-duplicate guard declining a dispatch, and the ordinary first half
